The '''Frozen Village''' is an island located in [[First Sea]].

At Frozen Village, players can encounter the [[Sword Dealer of the East]], the [[Ability Teacher]] to learn new skills from, and a [[Sick Man|Story NPC]] that is part of the [[Saber Expert/Puzzle|Saber Expert Puzzle]]. The Frozen Village also has the [[Ice Admiral]], which is part of the [[Second Sea]] quest.

==Appearance==
The Frozen Village is a plateau of medium height that rises above the surrounding sea. It is surrounded by broken ice sheets and covered in snow. The island has a few evergreen trees, houses, and ladders scattered about, as well as a hidden cave at the back and a dock at the front.

