== Secret Quests ==

* Go into the large cave on the island and punch the large block of ice with the [[Ability Teacher]] trapped in it. After the ice breaks, talk to the Ability Teacher.
* After waiting an unspecified amount of time at Frozen Village, a message will appear in chat saying: '''[[System Messages|''"It begins to snow heavily over Frozen Village..."'']]'''  Piles of snow will appear across the island and touching one will turn it into a snowball, which can be rolled to make it larger. Push three of these snowballs together to create a snowman.  After the quest is completed, the snowman will speak: "Whoa, I'm alive! It's been quite some time since the last time, thank you friend!"
* When [[Yeti (Boss)|Yeti]] awakens, a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"A dark energy awakens..."'']]'''  Find and destroy the three green ice blocks emitting green curse energy, three in total. This will start the boss sequence.  After they are defeated, a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"(Roblox username) put down the awakened Yeti!"'']]'''
* [[File:Snowman.jpg|thumb|A snowman built in the Frozen Village.]]

==Saber Expert Puzzle==
The Frozen Village contains the continuation of the [[Saber Expert/Puzzle|Saber Expert Puzzle]]. Inside a house, the player will find the [[Sick Man]], to whom they need to give a cup filled with water from a dripping icicle in the cave. After completing this task, the player can proceed to the [[Pirate Village]] to find the [[Rich Man]].

==Cave==
The main attraction of the Frozen Village is the '''secret cave''' where the Ability Teacher resides. The Ability Teacher teaches players how to use [[Flash Step]], [[Aura]], and [[Air Jump]]. Additionally, the '''cave''' is also home to the [[Ice Admiral]] who is part of the [[Military Detective|Military Detective's quest]] to reach the [[Second Sea]]. Furthermore, a dripping stalactite found in the cave is also part of the [[Saber Expert/Puzzle|Saber Expert Puzzle]].

==Trivia==
* The [[Soundtracks|theme]] at Frozen Village is called The Start Of Winter.
** This theme is also used in [[w:c:zombie-attack-roblox: Festive Village Map|Festive Village]]'s old theme from Zombie Attack.
* The Frozen Village is one of the five winter-themed islands in the game, the others being [[Snow Mountain]], [[Ice Castle]], [[Hot and Cold]] (cold side), and [[Candy Cane Land]] in the [[Sea of Treats]].

